{"id":"sangre","lemma":"sangre","pos":"noun","rank":310,"glosses":["blood"],"ipa":"/ˈsanɡɾe/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sangres"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-sangre.wav","formAudio":{"sangres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sangres.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Has perdido mucha sangre.","en":"You've lost a lot of blood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/202979"},{"text":"La enfermera me sacó sangre.","en":"The nurse drew my blood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/416153"},{"text":"Había sangre por todas partes.","en":"There was blood everywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75845"},{"text":"Tom empezó a toser sangre.","en":"Tom began coughing up blood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330768"},{"text":"Hoy fui a donar sangre.","en":"I went to donate blood today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586673"}]}